{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/c4c4c1dcd4eac4a03d0370738d720966.avif?t=1766403822\" width=780 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Military Logistics Simulator puts you behind the wheel of real-world military logistics. Rise from a low-ranking soldier to a seasoned quartermaster as you manage vehicles, expand your base, and take charge of critical supply lines. Deliver vital cargo and defend it from drone attacks and help survivors \u2014 all in immersive first-person simulation. Play solo or with friends and earn your place, leading military operations from behind the lines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/00bb2b7e5f34c3f13c9beabedc851407.webp?t=1766403822\" width=781 height=53 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/218ac2ad29134e1590695da487c97492.poster.avif?t=1766403822\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/218ac2ad29134e1590695da487c97492.webm?t=1766403822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/218ac2ad29134e1590695da487c97492.mp4?t=1766403822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transport, deploy, and maintain critical military infrastructure \u2014 from air defense systems to artillery logistics and UAV operations \u2014 across high-risk zones. Command your loyal German Shepherd to assist you and send him out to sniff out explosives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/c9ae89a96e6062857d186ec9f9fc0c39.webp?t=1766403822\" width=781 height=53 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/7c98e08827e79dfd0ec6856306c2cc4c.poster.avif?t=1766403822\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/7c98e08827e79dfd0ec6856306c2cc4c.webm?t=1766403822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/7c98e08827e79dfd0ec6856306c2cc4c.mp4?t=1766403822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate and maintain a wide range of real-world military vehicles, including recon trucks, heavy transporters, UAV carriers, and recovery units.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/f49bebc7ab245f61ad26033615e12353.webp?t=1766403822\" width=781 height=52 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/61fb137a1847f16e24353814286d8b18.poster.avif?t=1766403822\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/61fb137a1847f16e24353814286d8b18.webm?t=1766403822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/61fb137a1847f16e24353814286d8b18.mp4?t=1766403822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete high-value contracts to earn funds, drive new vehicles, upgrade your base, and unlock new vehicles and missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/d1225eef11b2e64ac2be41b932ca8790.webp?t=1766403822\" width=781 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/7125a4463e12a17a03c8f04f9acc15a7.poster.avif?t=1766403822\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/7125a4463e12a17a03c8f04f9acc15a7.webm?t=1766403822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/7125a4463e12a17a03c8f04f9acc15a7.mp4?t=1766403822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends to play exciting missions in Free Operations Mode together! Drive in convoys, fortify outposts and defend your base against enemy attacks.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/fec3467e3d957619eb9c9e4199fef1a9.webp?t=1766403822\" width=781 height=53 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FOSCON \u2013 Command Made Simple:</strong> Direct your convoy with Follow, Go-To, and Hold orders using a clear tactical HUD.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supply Missions &amp; Base Building:</strong> Deliver critical resources and expand your FOB to unlock equipment and upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defense-by-Logistics:</strong> Counter drone and ground threats using point-defense launchers and mounted heavy machine guns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>K9 Companion:</strong> Utilize your German Shepherd for detection and support tasks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Land &amp; Carrier Operations:</strong> Experience missions across overland routes and aboard an aircraft carrier.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-Player &amp; Co-Op:</strong> Command the convoy alone or bring a teammate into the field.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Logistics Adept","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2947540/68112ef5f3f599a83b3ff1280f852eb437249b0e.jpg"},{"name":"The Doctor is in","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2947540/ad9486568f039e43c503dc0de8cefd52c9cc5440.jpg"},{"name":"Oil Baron","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2947540/58a5904636ba94638b4346be6dae3fcc493a9387.jpg"},{"name":"Liberator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2947540/e20a5f1e667a32337c5a65985777807aaac20bca.jpg"},{"name":"Underground","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2947540/7c2d05ec6da26b4fe0a05be9f2e635599e4fc6b5.jpg"},{"name":"Full","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2947540/c4c0194ba4a4aaf33026e97091931dc876c06aeb.jpg"},{"name":"Cozy Place","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2947540/f3f8655caa7f9a94e1b303cc2bb7f6221d85e8e8.jpg"},{"name":"Burrow","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2947540/640ae5afda91848f22dc70b991cd8c74f2ffa491.jpg"},{"name":"Sweeper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2947540/de190cce72b8c9c62c692a7c254758290cc19cc4.jpg"},{"name":"It's not Over","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2947540/c78785a102371c2ad5324f7365