s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/f49bebc7ab245f61ad26033615e12353.webp?t=1766403822\" width=781 height=52 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/61fb137a1847f16e24353814286d8b18.poster.avif?t=1766403822\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/61fb137a1847f16e24353814286d8b18.webm?t=1766403822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/61fb137a1847f16e24353814286d8b18.mp4?t=1766403822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete high-value contracts to earn funds, drive new vehicles, upgrade your base, and unlock new vehicles and missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/d1225eef11b2e64ac2be41b932ca8790.webp?t=1766403822\" width=781 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/7125a4463e12a17a03c8f04f9acc15a7.poster.avif?t=1766403822\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/7125a4463e12a17a03c8f04f9acc15a7.webm?t=1766403822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/7125a4463e12a17a03c8f04f9acc15a7.mp4?t=1766403822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"